---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Managed DPP Data Hosting & Vault | Zero-Knowledge Cloud | EU DPP Provider"
  description="Turnkey battery passport data hosting. Delegate EU compliance, PCF carbon calculation, GS1 resolver hosting, and multi-party ZKP verification to our sovereign EU cloud."
>
  <div class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-stone-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
      
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono font-medium text-emerald-800 uppercase tracking-widest bg-emerald-50 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-emerald-200">
          Turnkey Compliance Service
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-semibold text-stone-900 tracking-tight mt-6 mb-6">
          Managed DPP Data Vault: Zero Infrastructure, 100% Peace of Mind
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-stone-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          Skip the expense, complexity, and ongoing maintenance of self-hosting. Entrust your battery passport data lifecycle to EU DPP Provider. We securely ingest supply chain materials, generate compliant GS1 digital links, and host high-availability EU sovereign resolver endpoints with guaranteed 99.99% uptime.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 3 Key Pillars -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 my-20">
        
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 shadow-soft space-y-3">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-2">🔒</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900">Zero-Knowledge Proofs (ZKP)</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">
            Your material recipes, anode/cathode proprietary formulations, and purchase costs are mathematically shielded. Regulators and downstream buyers only see cryptographically verified compliance certificates.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 shadow-soft space-y-3">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-2">🇪🇺</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900">Sovereign EU Cloud Infrastructure</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">
            Hosted entirely within certified Frankfurt and Paris data centers. Fully compliant with GDPR, EU Data Act, and Gaia-X trust frameworks.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 shadow-soft space-y-3">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-2">⚡</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900">Instant Ingestion & Batch API</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">
            Upload your product BOMs and test certificates via our secure Web Portal, standard Excel templates, or automated REST API webhooks. Passports go live instantly.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- How Managed Hosting Works -->
      <div class="p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-soft my-20">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-stone-900 mb-10 text-center">How Managed DPP Hosting Works</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-6 text-xs">
          <div class="p-6 bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-stone-900">STEP 01</span>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 mt-2 mb-2">Upload Data</div>
            <p class="text-stone-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">Submit battery model specs, test reports (UN 38.3, CE), and bill of materials via web dashboard or API.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-stone-900">STEP 02</span>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 mt-2 mb-2">Automated Audit & PCF</div>
            <p class="text-stone-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">Our engine calculates lifecycle carbon footprint and audits 90+ mandatory EU 2023/1542 data points.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-stone-900">STEP 03</span>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 mt-2 mb-2">GS1 QR Delivery</div>
            <p class="text-stone-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">Download printable GS1 Digital Link QR vectors or connect laser-marking printers via direct API.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-emerald-800">STEP 04</span>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 mt-2 mb-2">24/7 Sovereign Hosting</div>
            <p class="text-stone-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">We maintain the global resolver, handle regulator verification requests, and update compliance over time.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="text-center space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-stone-900">Get a Custom Data Hosting Proposal</h3>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex px-8 py-4 rounded-xl bg-stone-900 text-white font-medium text-base hover:bg-stone-800 transition-colors shadow-soft">
          Book Managed Hosting Consultation &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
